                                "sense_id": "c18aa5cb-f96c-39fa-9238-9d410dbf3941",
                                "text": "However, another study examining SOCS3 function in B cell subsets failed to detect B cell developmental and recirculatory defects in mice conditionally deficient in SOCS3 expression in B cells (using Mb1-cre mice), nor when SOCS3 was deleted in MMTV-cre active cells [21 ]."
